    - minInclusive: 26
      maxInclusive: 40
      ratingLabel: "R\u1EE7i ro cao  "
      feedback: "Vi\u1EC7c gi\u1EEF im l\u1EB7ng khi ph\xE1t hi\u1EC7n l\u1EEBa \u0111\u1EA3o
        c\xF3 th\u1EC3 khi\u1EBFn nh\u1EEFng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi b\u1EA1n xung quanh
        tr\u1EDF th\xE0nh n\u1EA1n nh\xE2n ti\u1EBFp theo. H\xE3y l\xEAn ti\u1EBFng!"
    - minInclusive: 41
      maxInclusive: 55
      ratingLabel: "Th\u1EE5 \u0111\u1ED9ng"
      feedback: "B\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 t\u1EF1 b\u1EA3o v\u1EC7 b\u1EA3n th\xE2n th\xE0nh
