        th\u1EDDi gian nh\u1EAFn m\u1ED9t tin c\u1EA3nh b\xE1o cho m\u1ECDi ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
        nh\xE9"
    - minInclusive: 56
      maxInclusive: 75
      ratingLabel: "Ch\u1EE7 \u0111\u1ED9ng"
      feedback: "B\u1EA1n l\xE0 m\u1ED9t th\xE0nh vi\xEAn r\u1EA5t c\xF3 tr\xE1ch
        nhi\u1EC7m! H\xE0nh \u0111\u1ED9ng nh\u1EAFc nh\u1EDF k\u1ECBp th\u1EDDi
        c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n tr\xEAn nh\xF3m l\u1EDBp \u0111\xE3 gi\xFAp nhi\u1EC1u
